00:03:05.279 --> 00:03:06.279
Yes.

00:03:06.279 --> 00:03:10.599
And of course, it's more complicated than
just even even the soybean explanation.

00:03:10.599 --> 00:03:14.230
But you're right that when we look back at
it, it may be misremembered.

